      <title>500万块电池包里程碑：特斯拉上海超级工厂，全球电动车心跳加速器？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251112-500%E4%B8%87%E5%9D%97%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%85%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E7%A2%91%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%A8%E8%BD%A6%E5%BF%83%E8%B7%B3%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E5%99%A8/</link>
